# Model config: Qwen3.8-27B (UD-Q4_K_XL, single-file GGUF) -- model-intrinsic only.
#
# Unsloth Dynamic V3.0 4-bit imatrix quant, ~16.7 GiB single file. Architecture,
# sampling rationale, KV math and thinking-control notes: see
# models/qwen3.8-27b.env -- this file only swaps the weights (and the
# projector, F16 to match).
#
# WHY THIS QUANT: the small-footprint option. It is the fleet assignment for
# the 32 GB MacBook Pro, and on the R9700s it is what buys a long context on a
# SINGLE card (Q8 leaves too little room for a 262K KV cache on 31 GiB).
# Unsloth's own table puts 4-bit at 17-19GB total RAM+VRAM for weights.
#
# Download:
#   hf download unsloth/Qwen3.8-27B-GGUF \
#     --include "Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf" \
#     --local-dir /data/models/Qwen3.8-27B

: "${MODEL:=Qwen3.8-27B/Qwen3.8-27B-UD-Q4_K_XL.gguf}"

LLAMA_ARGS+=(--temp 1.0 --top-p 0.95 --top-k 20 --min-p 0.0 --presence-penalty 0.0 --repeat-penalty 1.0)
LLAMA_ARGS+=(--mmproj "/models/Qwen3.8-27B/mmproj-F16.gguf")
LLAMA_ARGS+=(--alias qwen3.8-27b)
